          "body": "There are other options available, see https://github.blog/2020-12-21-get-up-to-speed-with-partial-clone-and-shallow-clone/\nA treeless clone (`git clone --filter=tree:0`) might improve the situation, but I don't see it available in https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/ci/yaml/README.html#configure-runner-behavior-with-variables\n\nThere unfortunately do not appear to be any variables that can be used to replace the `git describe` output either:\nhttps://docs.gitlab.com/ee/ci/variables/predefined_variables.html",
          "author": {
            "id": 2415432,
            "username": "Lekensteyn",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Peter Wu",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/efcf30db53f30b15e7c905ef37bd4dc44d87573bd92baf97cd707115d3fcd0c0?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/Lekensteyn"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-03-12T15:01:28.031Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-03-13T07:34:33.061Z",
          "system": false,
