        {
          "id": 528630937,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "How about GIT_FETCH_EXTRA_FLAGS (https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/ci/runners/README.html#git-fetch-extra-flags) for passing `--filter=tree:0` or `--filter=blob:none`?",
          "author": {
            "id": 7512212,
            "username": "jrnieder",
            "public_email": "",
