      "id": "8a28605ea7af2f8d8afae42c826df32c70063ef2",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 528344800,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Efficient cloning/fetching with a reachable tag is surprisingly difficult in GitLab's CI. I played around with adding `while ! git describe ; do git fetch --deepen=500 ; done` and `git fetch --shallow-exclude=...` to the .build-ubuntu before_script but didn't have much luck.",
